Monkeys roar and march to the sea seeking Sita --- Behold vast creature-filled ocean from northern shore --- Despair before impassable sea asking how to act --- Angada rebukes despair as slayer of enterprise --- Angada counsels elders through the night --- Army gathers round Angada like Maruts round Vasava --- Angada asks who will leap hundred yojanas and free them --- Army falls silent at Angada challenge --- Angada bids each declare his leaping power